# Harness Workflow

Use only the skill needed by the current task. Simple changes may finish after focused checks; complex work can use Spec, Executable Plan, review and Knowledge Cleanup as needed.
`review` includes fresh evidence judgment; `verify` is a trigger alias for review, not another gate.
`ship` chains implement, review and cleanup for one authorized end-to-end delivery.
Respect existing authorization; ask only for material unresolved decisions or new action scope. Reuse the selected recovery surface, one authoritative entry per task/track; independent tracks may proceed together.
Capability Recommendation and Harness Recommendation Matrix apply to real gaps, not a mandatory inventory. This rules adapter does not require creating .harness in projects using another backend.
Use canonical skills for details; do not duplicate their protocol in rules.
